#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:1
msgid "E4224"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_catchall_missing`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`lexscan_catchall_missing`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:5
msgid ""
"The regex cases in a `lexmatch` or `lexscan` expression are not "
"exhaustive, and the expression has no catch-all case."
msgstr "`lexmatch` 或 `lexscan` 表达式中的正则分支并不穷尽，并且该表达式没有兜底分支。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:8
msgid ""
"The compiler checks whether the regex cases cover every possible input, "
"including empty input and, for streaming scans, end of input. An "
"exhaustive expression may omit the catch-all. Otherwise, add a final "
"catch-all branch to define the result when no regex case matches."
msgstr "编译器会检查正则分支是否覆盖所有可能的输入，包括空输入，以及流式扫描的输入结束。如果表达式是穷尽的，可以省略兜底分支。否则，请添加最后的兜底分支，定义没有正则分支匹配时的结果。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:13
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(text : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    re\"^[a-z]+$\" => \"word\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:19
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:21
msgid ""
"Make the regex cases exhaustive, or add a final catch-all case. A "
"`lexmatch` catch-all may bind the unmatched input; a streaming `lexscan` "
"catch-all must be written as `_`. If a catch-all exists but is not last, "
"see [E4171](E4171.md)."
msgstr "使正则分支穷尽，或添加最后的兜底分支。`lexmatch` 的兜底分支可以绑定未匹配的输入；流式 `lexscan` 的兜底分支必须写成 `_`。如果存在兜底分支但它不在最后，请参见 [E4171](E4171.md)。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4224.md:25
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(text : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    re\"^.*$\" => \"text\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
